#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A corsair, a gatekeeper and an olive grower will speak before the judge."
msgstr "Un corsaire, un gardien de porte et une cultivatrice d'olives parleront devant le juge."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga's days as a tax collector are numbered."
msgstr "Les jours de l'Aga comme collecteur d'impôts sont comptés."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/15_kadi_of_preveza/mission.tres
